@startsalt
' Screen: Org Members Management
' User Stories:
'   - As an org owner, I want to see all current members and their roles
'   - As an org owner, I want to invite new members by email with a role assignment
'   - As an org owner, I want to see pending invitations and be able to resend or revoke them
'   - As an org owner, I want to change a member's role or remove them

{
  ' Top nav
  {
    <b>codefre.sh</b> | Scripts | Runs | Review Queue | <b>Settings</b>
    .
    <i>Acme Engineering</i> | keith@noizu.com
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>Organization Settings — Acme Engineering</b>
  }
  --
  {
    ' Sidebar
    {+
      <b>Settings</b>
      --
      General
      <b>Members</b>
      API Tokens
      SSO
      Freeball
      Webhooks
      Audit Log
    }
    |
    ' Content
    {
      <b>Members</b>
      ==
      ' Add member form
      {+
        <b>Invite a New Member</b>
        --
        {
          Email: "new.teammate@acme.com              " | Role: ^Editor^ | [Send Invitation]
        }
        <i>Roles: Owner — full admin | Admin — manage members & settings | Editor — manage scripts & runs | Viewer — read-only</i>
      }
      ==
      ' Members table
      {#
        <b>Email</b> | <b>Role</b> | <b>Status</b> | <b>Joined</b> | <b>Actions</b>
        keith@noizu.com | <b>Owner</b> | <color:green>Active</color> | 2026-01-15 | <i>(you)</i>
        alice@acme.com | Admin | <color:green>Active</color> | 2026-02-03 | [Change Role] [Remove]
        bob@acme.com | Editor | <color:green>Active</color> | 2026-03-18 | [Change Role] [Remove]
        carol@acme.com | Viewer | <color:orange>Pending</color> | Invited 2026-05-10 | [Resend] [Revoke]
      }
      --
      <i>4 members (3 active, 1 pending). Your plan allows up to 10 members.</i>
      ==
      ' Role change inline (modal prompt reference)
      {+
        <b>Change Role — alice@acme.com</b>
        --
        Current role: <b>Admin</b>
        New role: (X) Owner  ( ) Admin  ( ) Editor  ( ) Viewer
        --
        <color:orange>Promoting to Owner grants full organization control including billing and deletion.</color>
        --
        [Confirm Role Change] | [Cancel]
      }
    }
  }
}

@endsalt
